objection ... afford reasonable <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>\n\nto the consumer before passing final order of <b>assessment</b>.       In the instant\n\ncase, however, no such <b>opportunity</b> was either afforded", "docsize": 10940, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Punjab-Haryana High Court", "author": "L N Mittal", "authorEncoded": "l-n-mittal"}, {"tid": 85884693, "catids": [44, 1, 20], "doctype": 1017, "publishdate": "2016-09-07", "authorid": 790, "bench": [790], "title": "Rameshbhai Premajibhai Panjari vs Executive Engineer on 7 September, 2016", "numcites": 6, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "bill has been\n         issued     by the           respondent      authority,         without         giving          an\n         <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b> to the petitioner as provided ... provision of law as well as a breach of principles of <b>natural</b>\n         <b>justice</b>.\n \n\n          5.             On      the    other    hand,         Mr.S.P.Hasurkar,               learned\n         advocate appearing", "docsize": 16347, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Gujarat High Court", "author": "A J Desai", "authorEncoded": "a-j-desai"}, {"tid": 491504, "catids": [335, 1], "doctype": 1013, "publishdate": "2010-06-02", "authorid": null, "bench": [1646, 1116], "title": "Kerala State <b>Electricity</b> Board vs M/S.Lyril Plastics on 2 June, 2010", "numcites": 5, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": " Kerala State <b>Electricity</b> Board vs M/S.Lyril Plastics on 2 June, 2010 \n\n Bench:  Pius", "docsize": 12527, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Kerala High Court"}, {"tid": 515043, "catids": [1, 175], "doctype": 1007, "publishdate": "2007-12-14", "authorid": 1340, "bench": [1340], "title": "M/S.Bajarangabali Steels vs The Executive Engineer on 14 December, 2007", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "passed the orders in question without giving the petitioner a reasonable <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b> and without application of mind, contrary to the positive directions given ... violation of the principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b> as well as the terms and conditions of supply of <b>electricity</b>. \n \n \t9. It has also been stated that", "docsize": 8587, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Madras High Court", "author": "M Jaichandren", "authorEncoded": "m-jaichandren"}, {"tid": 76670745, "catids": null, "doctype": 1033, "publishdate": "2026-01-20", "authorid": 375, "bench": [375], "title": "Pandillapalli vs The Andhra Pradesh Central Power ... on 20 January, 2026", "numcites": 6, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "declare that\nsuch demands, raised without prior notice, proper <b>assessment</b>, or affording an\n<b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, are barred by limitation; and consequently set aside ... Constitution of\nIndia, the principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>, and contrary to  Section 56(2)  of the\n<b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003.\nlA NO: 1 OF 2025\n\n         Petition", "docsize": 6242, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Andhra Pradesh High Court - Amravati", "author": "N Jayasurya", "authorEncoded": "n-jayasurya"}, {"tid": 188595781, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-01-20", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Imamuddin vs State Of U.P. And 3 Others on 20 January, 2021", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. Amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> has been treated as final <b>assessment</b> ... without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n Considering the facts and circumstances of the case", "docsize": 6594, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 180955756, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-02-02", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Omkar Singh vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 2 February, 2021", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. Amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> has been treated as final <b>assessment</b> ... without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n Considering the facts and circumstances of the case", "docsize": 6909, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 193008358, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-01-18", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Musharraf vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 18 January, 2021", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. Amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> has been treated as final <b>assessment</b> ... considering the objection or affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n Considering the facts and circumstances", "docsize": 7260, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 47455569, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-02-03", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Nabban vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 3 February, 2021", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. Amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> has been treated as final <b>assessment</b> ... without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n In this view of the matter, we dispose", "docsize": 5535, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 71094695, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-01-21", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Radhey Shyam vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 21 January, 2021", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. Amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> has been treated as final <b>assessment</b> ... without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n Considering the facts and circumstances of the case", "docsize": 5876, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}], "found": "61 - 70 of 2291", "encodedformInput": "electricity%20assessment%20%22opportunity%20of%20hearing%22%20natural%20justice%20doctypes%3Ahighcourts"}